eType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2695393882,"text":"I decided to play a game with the little ones, and it seems they became quite invested...","nextNodeIds":[760500112]},{"nodeId":760500112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3472759418,"text":"Crowding around you like that after playtime... Kinda like puppies, aren't they?","nextNodeIds":[760500113]},{"nodeId":760500113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1689199794,"text":"Maybe that's their way of showing gratitude.","nextNodeIds":[760500114]},{"nodeId":760500114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":698587410,"text":"Mm... Only this time, their gratitude felt more like getting caught in an unexpected snow drift...","nextNodeIds":[760500115]},{"nodeId":760500115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":391745658,"text":"You say that, but Paimon bets you never pass up a chance to spoil them!","nextNodeIds":[760500116]},{"nodeId":760500116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":97170106,"text":"In any case, would the two of you like to give it a try?","nextNodeIds":[760500117,760500119]},{"nodeId":760500117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4042588506,"text":"You mean... being surrounded like that?","nextNodeIds":[760500118]},{"nodeId":760500118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":4133371418,"text":"Hm... That can be arranged. You just need to get the right answer.","nextNodeIds":[760500121]},{"nodeId":760500121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":988432402,"text":"Oh, sure thing. It'll be cool to see what sort of game's got the kuuhenki so obsessed.","nextNodeIds":[760500122]},{"nodeI